WEBVTT

00:00.250 --> 00:03.100
What if your next post wasn't buried in a feed?

00:04.650 --> 00:06.725
What if it was the only one?

00:08.850 --> 00:14.375
ONE is one shared screen. Take it, and your message
is what everyone on ONE sees.

00:15.750 --> 00:17.325
Start a debate.

00:18.900 --> 00:20.650
Make someone's day.

00:22.200 --> 00:24.975
Then someone takes it from you. Your move.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.825
Go to oneis.live. Take the screen.
